WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:07.317
Episode 2, Scene 14, Cut 1, Take 1.

00:00:10.016 --> 00:00:10.725
(Action.)

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.739
[RADIATING THEIR BRIGHTNESS IN THE MORNING.]

00:00:18.755 --> 00:00:22.491
(So, today you guys are shooting the first queue.)

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:23.170
Right.

00:00:23.191 --> 00:00:23.989
We don’t have a slate girl,

00:00:24.008 --> 00:00:25.845
so this young lady took the job.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:28.053
Yep. I’m a newbie.

00:00:28.068 --> 00:00:29.122
(You don’t look familiar at all.)

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:31.694
The most beautiful clapper loader.

00:00:31.694 --> 00:00:32.468
[THE MOST BEAUTIFUL!!]

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:33.497
Cough!
[THE MOST BEAUTIFUL!!]

00:00:33.508 --> 00:00:34.432
Coughing.
[THE MOST BEAUTIFUL!!]

00:00:34.432 --> 00:00:35.290
[THE MOST BEAUTIFUL!!]

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:40.170
[P’PAM, YOU’RE GETTING TOO CLOSE!]

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:51.530
[THE SONG MUST BE SO FUN, HUH?]

00:00:51.893 --> 00:00:52.491
Rak.

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:54.614
You didn’t hear that.
[YOU’RE NOT SUPPOSED TO HEAR THAT.]

00:00:54.614 --> 00:00:55.570
[YOU’RE NOT SUPPOSED TO HEAR THAT.]

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.730
[SHE HASN’T POKED YOU YET.]

00:00:59.401 --> 00:01:00.733
Take off your headphones and say,

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:02.102
- "P’Pam, when did you come?"
- P’Pam!!

00:01:02.231 --> 00:01:03.254
Too much.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:04.400
[THAT’S A BIT MUCH.]

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:04.970
P’Pam, when did you get here?
[THAT’S A BIT MUCH.]

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:06.161
P’Pam, when did you get here?

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:08.103
Keep your voice down. Take off the headphones.

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:11.330
[ALWAYS CLINGY.]

00:01:15.045 --> 00:01:16.142
It’s our club name.

00:01:16.157 --> 00:01:17.505
Aek founded it.

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:22.690
[A BIT MORE BRIEFING.]

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:26.930
[WHY ARE YOU STARING AT NONG SO INTENSELY?]

00:01:31.263 --> 00:01:32.611
My work isn’t expensive at all.

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:34.223
It’s just 1,000 baht.

00:01:35.714 --> 00:01:38.004
Why do people undervalue my work so much?

00:01:38.004 --> 00:01:38.970
[HOW DRAMATIC.]

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:41.274
What’s the panting?

00:01:42.525 --> 00:01:43.270
My hands.

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:48.570
[THAT’S A FULL MEAL.]

00:01:58.480 --> 00:01:59.810
[THE GIRL WHO CAN’T SIT STILL.]

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:09.730
[YOU SEEM CAPTIVATED.]

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:14.730
[WHAT’S THE TEA, LADIES?]

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:23.210
[BEAUTIFUL SKETCH OF P’PAM.]

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:31.210
[OOPS! ALMOST KNOCKED IT DOWN.]

00:02:36.597 --> 00:02:37.945
(Check out that bottle shot.)

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:42.290
[CHECKING THEIR SCENE.]

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:49.130
[TIME TO SHOWCASE HER SKILL.]

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:52.290
[GETTING BRIEFED A BIT MORE.]

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:01.130
[PLAYING SO ELEGANTLY.]

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:07.530
[GETTING READY FOR THE SCENE.]

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:10.921
I can’t drink.

00:03:11.038 --> 00:03:12.014
(Why not?)

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:13.602
I’m still underage.

00:03:13.602 --> 00:03:15.410
[HMM?]

00:03:25.254 --> 00:03:26.737
(Did you do it the way you practiced?)

00:03:26.848 --> 00:03:27.445
Sorry?

00:03:27.469 --> 00:03:28.640
(Did you do it the way you practiced?)

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:30.063
It was a bit off.

00:03:31.939 --> 00:03:33.626
(You didn’t practice with this guitar, right?)

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:37.305
- (So you’re not familiar with it.)
- That’s right. I practiced with the pink one.

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:45.820
(The audience mustn’t miss this scene
if they want to hear this song, right?)

00:03:45.988 --> 00:03:46.950
That’s right.

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:54.220
[WHAT A POSE.]

00:03:54.256 --> 00:03:55.420
Rak’s singing was beautiful, right?

00:03:55.663 --> 00:03:56.760
Why, yes! Beautiful.

00:03:57.151 --> 00:03:58.397
You mean, "Why did she need to sing?" right?

00:03:58.390 --> 00:03:59.960
(Is this your first time hearing Bonnie sing?)
[BONNIE, DON’T TEASE YOURSELF.]

00:03:59.982 --> 00:04:00.710
It is.

00:04:00.798 --> 00:04:02.616
It’s so good I thought they were playing a CD.

00:04:02.908 --> 00:04:04.176
Actually, they were.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.637
So good I thought it was from a cassette.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.302
(A cassette? Come on. How old!)
[OKAY, VINTAGE GIRL.]

00:04:08.302 --> 00:04:09.010
[OKAY, VINTAGE GIRL.]

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.570
[CHEERING RIGHT IN FRONT OF THE STAGE.]

00:04:29.124 --> 00:04:30.001
(How was it?)

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.000
[THE CAMERA CAN’T STEAL HER ATTENTION AT ALL.]

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:34.690
So great.
[THE CAMERA CAN’T STEAL HER ATTENTION AT ALL.]

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:36.416
(How are you doing?)

00:04:36.431 --> 00:04:37.440
(Can we see your fingers?)

00:04:38.084 --> 00:04:39.133
They’re all damaged.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:46.210
[CHANGING THE GUITAR.]

00:04:48.179 --> 00:04:52.490
(If the patrons don’t like her music,
they can go to another bar.)
[THE SINGER AT THIS BAR CAN DO NO WRONG.]

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.361
[YOU DON’T LOOK NERVOUS AT ALL.]

00:04:58.397 --> 00:05:03.493
♪ These eyes of mine belong only to you ♪

00:05:03.909 --> 00:05:07.179
♪ How can I kiss you beyond just my dreams? ♪

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:07.840
♪ Next time we meet ♪

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:09.186
[LET’S ENJOY THE SONG.]
♪ Next time we meet ♪

00:05:09.183 --> 00:05:10.490
♪ I wanna hold you closer than before ♪
[LET’S ENJOY THE SONG.]

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:14.000
♪ I wanna hold you closer than before ♪

00:05:15.459 --> 00:05:20.198
♪ Let our hearts feel what true love really means ♪

00:05:20.293 --> 00:05:23.234
♪ What should I do to make it come true? ♪

00:05:23.459 --> 00:05:25.694
♪ Can't hold it in ♪

00:05:26.026 --> 00:05:29.490
♪ You probably don't know how I feel ♪

00:05:30.124 --> 00:05:34.440
♪ That I'm in love with you head over heels ♪

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:40.440
[RIGHT HERE SHOWING SUPPORT.]

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:50.890
[WHAT A SWEET WAY TO CHECK THE SHOT.]

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:00.970
[ANOTHER BRIEF BEFORE SHOOTING.]

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:08.850
[THE SWEET STARE.]

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:11.965
Time’s up!

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:14.004
So?

00:06:14.245 --> 00:06:15.265
Did you get your answer?

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:23.530
[SOMEONE IS SECRETLY SMILING.]

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:32.050
SATURDAYS AT 8:30 P.M. ON GMM25

